7
00:00:56,036 --> 00:01:00,084
One more step and you'll fall into madness.

8
00:01:01,004 --> 00:01:05,084
Don't fall down.

9
00:01:07,048 --> 00:01:09,004
I look towards the top.

10
00:01:09,012 --> 00:01:11,068
Chase !

11
00:01:11,088 --> 00:01:14,088
Refined to perfection.

12
00:01:16,044 --> 00:01:20,080
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

13
00:01:20,092 --> 00:01:23,084
I dare to defy the heavens !

14
00:01:24,032 --> 00:01:27,068
Always overcome the obstacles,

15
00:01:27,087 --> 00:01:30,004
ignite the seas with blood,

16
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:34,048
bloom through trials and tribulations.

17
00:01:34,064 --> 00:01:39,012
Even the sharpest thorns

18
00:01:39,024 --> 00:01:43,068
will be reduced into ashes.

19
00:01:43,072 --> 00:01:48,000
What is there to fear ?

20
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:57,016
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

