00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:12,095
Xu Mu ?

22
00:03:14,024 --> 00:03:15,079
I'll remember this name.

23
00:03:19,064 --> 00:03:20,067
Named Xu ?

24
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,059
You also thought of it...

25
00:03:24,032 --> 00:03:26,031
For such a powerful Corporeal Yang cultivator to appear,

26
00:03:26,048 --> 00:03:28,079
it has to be the Xu Family of Planet Dong Lin.

27
00:03:29,096 --> 00:03:30,095
Could this person be...

28
