31
00:03:40,084 --> 00:03:42,015
But Uncle Ping and the others...

32
00:03:42,076 --> 00:03:44,055
They acted recklessly.

33
00:03:45,072 --> 00:03:47,036
Since they're dead, they're dead.

34
00:03:48,052 --> 00:03:49,023
Understood.

35
00:03:54,060 --> 00:03:57,072
Inside the Celestial Cave

36
00:03:54,092 --> 00:03:55,087
Brother Xu,

37
00:03:56,008 --> 00:03:58,091
this cave seems somewhat peculiar.

38
00:04:00,048 --> 00:04:01,019
Look,

39
00:04:01,072 --> 00:04:02,095
on the walls around us,

40
00:04:03,028 --> 00:04:05,044
there are traces of celestial spiritual energy fluctuations.

41
00:04:05,092 --> 00:04:08,023
It must have been isolated from the outside for very long.

42
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:11,099
Since this place was left by Celestials,

43
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,063
it's strange that no one visited it

44
00:04:15,008 --> 00:04:16,019
before us.

45
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:26,023
We have been moving at full speed

46
00:04:26,064 --> 00:04:28,011
