47
00:04:28,068 --> 00:04:30,003
Why haven't we reached the end yet ?

48
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:33,015
Just how deep is this tunnel ?

49
00:04:34,096 --> 00:04:36,015
Something's wrong.

50
00:04:40,088 --> 00:04:41,035
Brother Xu,

51
00:04:41,048 --> 00:04:42,007
