52
00:04:42,092 --> 00:04:44,043
Do you sense anything unusual ?

53
00:04:45,012 --> 00:04:46,039
What do you mean, Brother Xu ?

54
00:04:47,032 --> 00:04:48,051
Since we entered,

55
00:04:49,004 --> 00:04:50,091
I have been using my Divine Sense to probe the path ahead

56
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,035
and mark our way back.

57
00:04:53,072 --> 00:04:54,051
But I discovered

58
00:04:55,072 --> 00:04:57,003
