62
00:05:05,052 --> 00:05:08,019
This rune is a type of celestial restriction.

63
00:05:08,052 --> 00:05:09,031
It's extremely rare

64
00:05:09,068 --> 00:05:10,095
and can't be used by itself.

65
00:05:11,044 --> 00:05:13,079
It needs to be combined with other runes

66
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,075
