72
00:05:31,028 --> 00:05:32,071
Before we reach the end,

73
00:05:33,032 --> 00:05:34,075
it will be impossible to determine

74
00:05:35,060 --> 00:05:36,071
what formation it is.

75
00:05:37,052 --> 00:05:39,055
The Celestial Realm has been shattered for so long

76
00:05:39,084 --> 00:05:41,095
