161
00:09:38,092 --> 00:09:42,008
Wasteland\NThunder Celestial Realm

162
00:09:43,048 --> 00:09:44,023
Brother Xu !

163
00:09:54,032 --> 00:09:54,087
Brother Li,

164
00:09:55,004 --> 00:09:55,083
