173
00:10:45,008 --> 00:10:46,007
Celestial spells...

174
00:10:46,060 --> 00:10:47,051
Celestial spells !

175
00:10:59,032 --> 00:11:00,044
Not enough !

176
00:11:00,044 --> 00:11:01,055
