284
00:18:02,092 --> 00:18:04,032
Forbidden ground guardian\NLu Family cultivator\NCorporeal Yang

285
00:18:02,092 --> 00:18:04,032
Forbidden ground guardian\NSong Family cultivator\NCorporeal Yang

